term use—not just presentation."}]}],["$","$L26","4",{"title":"What kind of web or app projects do you handle?","serial":"04","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"font-montserrat","children":"We handle business-focused platforms such as internal portals, automation-driven tools, dashboards, eCommerce builds, and custom web applications. Our work prioritizes stability, security, and future scalability."}]}],["$","$L26","5",{"title":"How do you manage projects and communication?","serial":"05","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"font-montserrat","children":"Every project runs on a structured workflow with clear milestones, assigned ownership, and transparent tracking. You’ll always know what’s in progress, what’s next, and where things stand—without chasing updates."}]}],["$","$L26","6",{"title":"Do you offer long-term support after delivery?","serial":"06","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"font-montserrat","children":"Yes. Many clients continue with us for ongoing support, improvements, and scaling. We adapt as your needs evolve—without forcing long-term contracts."}]}]]}]]}]]}]
